The '''Fireslinger''' is a type of [[Mob]] and [[Goblin (disambiguation)|Goblin]] that spawns in the {{Zone|Dwarven Mines}} and {{Zone|Crystal Hollows}}.

== Spawning ==
'''Fireslingers''' spawn naturally in the {{Zone|Goblin Holdout}} in the {{Zone|Crystal Hollows}}, in the {{Zone|Goblin Burrows}} in the {{Zone|Dwarven Mines}}, and during [[Goblin Raid]]s in the {{Zone|Dwarven Mines}}.

